: SKR:s undersökning om brukarens uppfattning av kvalitet inom verksamheter för boende för barn och unga."}},{"@id":"_:4d7253f74b6f8fc625a13ec5ac24b2c4c619a5e53b6fb519c601573d4eb1a928_b1n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Address","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#country-name":"Sverige","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasURL":{"@id":"https://rka.nu"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#locality":"Stockholm","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#postal-code":"118 20","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#street-address":"Hornsgatan 15"},{"@id":"http://api.kolada.se/v3/","@type":["dcat:DataService","http://entryscape.com/terms/IndependentDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://rka.entryscape.net/resource/contactpoint/kolada"},"dcat:endpointURL":{"@id":"http://api.kolada.se/v3/kpi"},"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://www.kolada.se/om-oss/api/"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2220000315"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kolada API"},"dct:type":{"@id":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q749568"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://api.kolada.se/v3/docs"}},{"@id":"http://api.kolada.se/v3/kpi/U33787","@type":["dcat:Dataset","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServedByDataService"],"dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://rka.entryscape.net/resource/contactpoint/kolada"},"dcat:distribution":{"@id":"http://api.kolada.se/v3/kpi/U33787_json"},"dcat:keyword":["Rådet för främjande av kommunala analyser - Kolada",{"@language":"sv","@value":"Kommun"}],"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/GOVE"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/HEAL"}],"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:accrualPeriodicity":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL"},"dct:description":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Antal svar för brukarundersökningen  inom placerade barn och unga, området familjehem. Antal svar avses antal personer som svarat på minst en fråga. Om kommunen har färre än 10 svarande markeras detta med (..). Data finns tillgängligt enligt könsuppdelning."},"dct:identifier":"U33787","dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2025-12-08"},"dct:provenance":{"@id":"_:4d7253f74b6f8fc625a13ec5ac24b2c4c619a5e53b6fb519c601573d4eb1a928_b0n0"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2220000315"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Brukarbedömning familjehem, antal svar"},"http://entryscape.com/terms/servedByDataService":{"@id":"http://api.kolada.se/v3/"}},{"@id":"http://api.kolada.se/v3/kpi/U33787_json","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessService":{"@id":"http://api.kolada.se/v3/"},"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"http://api.kolada.se/v3/kpi/U33787"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Datatjänst med information på svenska"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/stable"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2220000315","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NonGovernmentalOrganisation"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://rka.nu/"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:rka@rka.nu"},"foaf:name":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The Council for Advocacy of Municipal Analysis - Kolada"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Rådet för främjande av kommunala analyser - Kolada"}]},{"@id":"https://rka.entryscape.net/resource/contactpoint/kolada","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Rådet för