 som har dokumenterats i patientens journal redovisas. Avser produktion (besök gjorda inom länet, oavsett var patienten är folkbokförd). "},"dct:identifier":"N72809","dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-05-27"},"dct:provenance":{"@id":"_:69561a31b22d305d52a7191057c8a00069b102d951b81069925b9cd5239b8316_b0n0"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2220000315"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Andra besök än läkarbesök mödrahälsovård, antal/1000 inv"},"http://entryscape.com/terms/servedByDataService":{"@id":"http://api.kolada.se/v3/"}},{"@id":"http://api.kolada.se/v3/kpi/N72809_json","@type":["dcat:Distribution","http://entryscape.com/terms/ServiceDistribution"],"dcat:accessService":{"@id":"http://api.kolada.se/v3/"},"dcat:accessURL":{"@id":"http://api.kolada.se/v3/kpi/N72809"},"dct:format":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/JSON"},"dct:license":{"@id":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"},"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Datatjänst med information på svenska"},"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/r5r/availability/stable"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2220000315","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NonGovernmentalOrganisation"},"foaf:homepage":{"@id":"https://rka.nu/"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:rka@rka.nu"},"foaf:name":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The Council for Advocacy of Municipal Analysis - Kolada"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Rådet för främjande av kommunala analyser - Kolada"}]},{"@id":"https://rka.entryscape.net/resource/contactpoint/kolada","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Rådet för främjande av kommunala analyser","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":{"@id":"_:69561a31b22d305d52a7191057c8a00069b102d951b81069925b9cd5239b8316_b1n0"}